, HSE, quality and cleaning audits, and lists a free plan and paid plans from $14 a month (checked 19 November 2026). <em>Better when:</em> you are one person walking a building with floor plans and want photos pinned to the drawing, at a low monthly price.</li><li><strong>Quickler</strong> (<a href=\"/pages/how-it-works.html\">how it works</a>). The inspection runs in WhatsApp. The person on the job answers by voice note, text or photo, in any order, and the report is written in your own Word or PDF layout. No app to install, no login. <em>Better when:</em> the write-up is where the time goes, or people will not open another app on site.</li></ul><p>Side by side: <a href=\"/pages/safetyculture-alternative-uk.html\">Quickler and SafetyCulture</a>, <a href=\"/pages/goaudits-alternative-uk.html\">Quickler and GoAudits</a>, <a href=\"/pages/lumiform-alternative-uk.html\">Quickler and Lumiform</a>.</p>"
